# Dawnhand Dissident lets its controller cast "creature spells" from among the cards exiled with it. An adventurer card is cast as
# its Adventure or as itself, and only that face is the spell (CR 715.3a-b): Bonecrusher Giant exiled with the Dissident may be cast
# as the Giant, a creature spell, but not as Stomp, an instant. Bot1 surveils the Giant into its graveyard on turn three (blighting
# the Dissident, 0/1) and exiles it on turn five (blighting its Sylvan Caryatid twice, 0/1). With five mana open and three
# counters there, Stomp is refused; the Giant is cast for {2}{R} and the three counters removed (CR 118.8).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Dawnhand Dissident
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sylvan Caryatid
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Bonecrusher Giant
Mountain
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

